[1495.673822, "o", "== 4. a user pays for a question; the payment is split among owners\r\n"]
[1530.899176, "o", "paid 0.01 NEAR  tx 9dTx7PvuSEG2oV5fiPzJePdBt1un3vUYMTfMffppnyzs"]
[1530.900789, "o", "\r\nLaing distal myopathy is caused by mutations in the MYH7 gene. This gene provides instructions for making one of two versions (isoforms) of the cardiac muscle protein myosin heavy chain 7. The isoform produced from the normal version of the MYH7 gene forms part of the thin filaments within muscle cells. Thin filaments interact with other proteins to form motor units, which are groups of muscle fibers that contract when stimulated. Motor units attach at their ends to connective tissue called the sarcolemma. The sarcolemma separates motor units so they do not overlap\r\n"]
[1530.967413, "o", "== 5. who owns the model, and what they earned\r\n"]
